    "title": "Emmy Noether: Modern LaTeX Working Corpus and Multilingual Translation Readers",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21426158",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-18",
    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing Emmy Noether working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. It retains the German R823 source-control reader, the English working corpus, the 473-page Spanish and 494-page French R823 readers, Interslavic Latin/Cyrillic readers, and bounded CJK/Korean, Slavic, Arabic/Persian, and Indonesian components.</p><p><strong>New Paper 30 source-control supplement:</strong> <code>00a_Noether_German_R823_Paper30_HardMath_AuditedWorkingReader_20260718.pdf</code> is a 466-page German cumulative working reader with a bounded direct-source audit of Paper 30 source pages 37-61. File <code>15</code> groups the corrected TeX, exact R823 diff, direct source slice, enlarged symbol witnesses, two-pass LuaLaTeX build log, hashes, and audit note.</p><p>The audit restores source-visible Greek exponent variables, a sigma/varrho distinction, a Fraktur-variable distinction, source line flow, and German quotation typography. It also records and rejects one web-session false positive: ordinary German <code>durch</code> had been misread as literal <code>dnrch</code> from the Fraktur glyph shape. The corrected cumulative source rebuilt to 466 pages with zero forbidden diagnostics.</p><p><strong>French R823 reader:</strong> <code>02d_Noether_French_R823_Cumulative_WorkingTranslation_20260718.pdf</code> remains the 494-page cumulative French working translation with its exact TeX/evidence closure in file <code>14</code>. Existing translations have not been silently declared synchronized to the new German Paper 30 patch.</p><p><strong>Status caveat:</strong> these are substantial source-control working editions and translations, not critical editions, complete Paper 30 or whole-corpus certification, native-language certificates, peer review, mathematical proof checking, or guarantees that every symbol and translation choice is error-free.</p><p><strong>GitHub:</strong> corrections and improvements can be proposed through issues or pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
